.TH destroyCoords 1 "Version 1.03: July 2003"
.SH NAME
.B destroyCoords
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "ccSHT.h"
.PP
.BI "void destroyCoords(coordStruct *" coords " );"
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION

This is the destructor function for the coordStruct structure.  
It frees up the vectors, and sets all of the fields to zero of 
the structure pointed to by the input argument 
.BR "coords" "."

